▁Y ashobe amu ▁mwen e ▁Zabudi eli ▁n iwe ▁ yaabaire ▁na areeberera ▁orubu ▁rw ' okubanza ▁omu ▁kwezi ▁kw ' okubanza ; ▁ab ' orubu ▁rwe ▁bakaba ▁bari ▁obukumi ▁bubiri ▁n ' enkumi ▁ina .
