▁nimuba ra ▁ebiro ▁m akumi ▁ataano ▁o kuhitsya ▁aha ▁izooba ▁eririkukurat a ▁sabato ▁ya ▁mushanju ; ▁obwo ▁murya reeta ▁empongano ▁y ' esaano ▁y ' omwaka ▁musya ▁y ' okuhongyera ▁MUKAMA .
▁Obwo ▁nibwo ▁nd yegyesa ▁abasiisi ▁emihanda ▁yaawe , ▁N ' e nkozi ▁z ' ebibi ▁zika kuhindukira .
▁Barunaba ▁ogwo ▁akaba ▁ari ▁omushaija ▁murungi , ▁o ijwire ▁Omwoyo ▁Orikwera ▁n ' okwikiriza ; ▁kandi ▁abantu ▁baingi ▁baija , ▁baaye hongyera ▁Mukama .
▁Ogwo ▁nigwo ▁mugabo ▁gwa ▁Arooni ▁n ' abatabani ▁ogw ihirwe ▁omu ▁mpongano ▁ezo okiibwe ▁omu ▁muriro , ▁ebi hairweyo ▁ahari ▁MUKAMA , ▁ogwabai hiirwe ho ▁aha ▁izooba ▁eri ▁baamu riki irweho ▁omu ▁maisho ▁ga ▁MUKAMA ▁kumuheereza ▁nk ' abanyamurwa ▁be ;
