▁Yaa rabya ▁abatabani ▁omu ▁muriro ▁omu ▁ruhanga ▁rwa ▁mwen e ▁Hinoomu ; ▁yaaguma ▁naa raguza ▁abafumu ▁ebiribaho , ▁na arogyesa , ▁na akoresa ▁abateezi ▁b ' ebyatsi , ▁na ayehanuuza ▁aha ▁bariku gambisa ▁emizimu ▁n ' aha ▁ barogi . ▁Yaakor a ▁ebibi ▁bingi ▁omu ▁maisho ▁ga ▁MUKAMA , ▁yaamugwisa ▁kubi .
